# Baked into the production web build (Vercel AND the GitHub Actions APK build).
# The new Render backend (orbit-2) handles REST + OAuth + Socket.io on the
# same origin — no Cloudflare Worker proxy, no Railway hop. Worker was
# returning 404 and the previous Render was on a free-tier cold start.
VITE_API_URL=https://orbit-2-he28.onrender.com/api
VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://orbit-2-he28.onrender.com
# OAuth (Google/GitHub) hits the backend DIRECTLY — passport pins
# redirect_uri to the backend's own origin. Must match BACKEND_URL on
# Render + the redirect URIs registered in Google Cloud / GitHub.
VITE_OAUTH_URL=https://orbit-2-he28.onrender.com
